### =====================================================================
### 阶段 0：健康检查
### =====================================================================

### 0.1 查看 OpenAPI 文档（确认服务在线 + M4 路由已注册）
GET {{host}}/api-docs.json

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 1：平台管理员登录
### =====================================================================

### 1.1 平台管理员登录 → 回填 @platformToken
POST {{host}}/api/platform/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{platformEmail}}",
  "password": "{{platformPassword}}"
}

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 2：创建测试团队（M4 前置依赖：需要翻译配额）
### =====================================================================

### 2.1 创建团队（translationQuota 给大些）→ 回填 @teamId / @supervisorId / @supervisorPassword
###     initialPassword 仅此一次返回，切勿丢失
POST {{host}}/api/platform/teams
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "M4测试团队_翻译代理",
  "supervisorEmail": "{{supervisorEmail}}",
  "expiresAt": "2028-06-30T23:59:59+08:00",
  "portQuota": 3,
  "translationQuota": 1000000
}

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 3：主管登录 + 生成密钥 + 客户端激活（拿 clientAccessToken）
### =====================================================================

### 3.1 主管登录 → 回填 @supervisorToken
POST {{host}}/api/supervisor/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{supervisorEmail}}",
  "password": "{{supervisorPassword}}"
}

### 4.1 生成密钥 → 回填 @licenseKeyId / @licenseCode
POST {{host}}/api/supervisor/licenses
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname": "客服M4-01",
  "multiDeviceEnabled": false
}

### 5.1 客户端激活 → 回填 @clientAccessToken / @clientId
POST {{host}}/api/client/activate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "{{licenseCode}}",
  "fingerprint": "{{fingerprint}}",
  "deviceLabel": "M4测试机-Mac"
}

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 4：T4-02 / T4-03 客户端翻译代理
### =====================================================================

### 6.1 翻译（无配置任何 Key）→ 预期 503 TRANSLATION_SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE
###     错误信息：未配置任何可用的翻译引擎 Key
POST {{host}}/api/client/translate
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "こんにちは、お名前は何ですか？",
  //"sourceLang": "en",
  "targetLang": "zh",
  "direction": "IN"
}

### 6.2 翻译（目标语言不支持）→ 预期 400 LANGUAGE_UNSUPPORTED
###     选路第一层：语言不在任一引擎支持清单中
POST {{host}}/api/client/translate
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Hello",
  "targetLang": "xx",
  "direction": "IN"
}

### 6.3 翻译（超长文本分片，T4-05 用例，离线会 503 NETWORK，属预期）
###     单条 ≤ ENGINE_MAX_CHARS(5000) 直翻；超出按句子边界分片(≤ CHUNK_SIZE 4500)逐片翻译
POST {{host}}/api/client/translate
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "This is a very long message. It will be split into chunks if it exceeds the limit. 这是一段很长的中文内容，用于验证超长消息的分片翻译逻辑是否按句子边界正确切分并逐片调用引擎后合并。",
  //"sourceLang": "en",
  "targetLang": "ja",
  "direction": "IN"
}

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 5：T4-06 翻译 API Key 管理（平台管理员专属）
### =====================================================================

### 7.1 Key 列表（初始应为空）→ 预期 200 + data.items=[]
GET {{host}}/api/platform/translation-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}

### 7.2 新增 Google Key（沙箱无网 → 连通性校验 NETWORK 放行，返回 201 + connectivityWarning）
###     → 回填 @translationKeyId
###     响应含 maskedKey（掩码，永不返回明文）、connectivityWarning
POST {{host}}/api/platform/translation-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "engine": "GOOGLE",
  "name": "M4-GOOGLE-测试",
  "apiKey": "FAKE_GOOGLE_KEY_FOR_SANDBOX",
  "quotaLimit": 500000
}

### 7.3 新增 DeepL Key（同 7.2，离线放行）
POST {{host}}/api/platform/translation-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "engine": "DEEPL",
  "name": "M4-DEEPL-测试3",
  "apiKey": "{{deepLKey3}}",
  "quotaLimit": null
}

### 7.4 Key 列表（应含 2 条，含掩码 / 状态 / 引擎聚合 engineAgg / 风险提示 riskHints）
###     engineAgg: 各引擎 Key 数 + 可用数 + 额度汇总
###     riskHints: 无可用 Key / 额度将尽 / 近窗失败等提示
GET {{host}}/api/platform/translation-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}

### 7.5 单个 Key 详情 → 预期 200 + 掩码字段
GET {{host}}/api/platform/translation-keys/{{translationKeyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}

### 7.6 修改 Key（名称 / 额度上限）→ 预期 200
PUT {{host}}/api/platform/translation-keys/{{translationKeyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "M4-GOOGLE-改名",
  "quotaLimit": 800000
}

### 7.7 停用 Key（无删除，仅 DISABLED）→ 预期 200 + status=DISABLED
POST {{host}}/api/platform/translation-keys/{{translationKeyId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "DISABLED"
}

### 7.8 重新启用 Key → 预期 200 + status=ACTIVE
POST {{host}}/api/platform/translation-keys/{{translationKeyId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 7.9 单 Key 近 24h 用量（T4-07）→ 预期 200 + usedChars / usageCount / failures 等
GET {{host}}/api/platform/translation-keys/{{translationKeyId}}/usage
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}

### 7.10 字段校验：缺 apiKey → 预期 400
POST {{host}}/api/platform/translation-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "engine": "GOOGLE",
  "name": "非法Key"
}

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 6：T4-04 语种清单维护
### =====================================================================

### 8.1 语种支持列表（启动已预置，GOOGLE 131 / DEEPL 33）→ 预期 200 + 数组
GET {{host}}/api/platform/engines/languages
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}

### 8.2 手动维护某语言支持状态（如标记 DeepL 不支持某小语种）→ 预期 200
###     status=SUPPORTED | UNSUPPORTED；将影响 T4-03 选路第一层
POST {{host}}/api/platform/engines/languages
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "engine": "DEEPL",
  "languageCode": "zh",
  "status": "SUPPORTED"
}

### 8.3 再次查看列表确认 8.2 生效（DeepL.zh 状态变更）
GET {{host}}/api/platform/engines/languages
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}

### =====================================================================
### 阶段 7：T4-02 回归（已配置 Key 后，离线仍 503 NETWORK，属预期）
### =====================================================================

### 9.1 已配置 Key 但沙箱无网 → 预期 503 TRANSLATION_SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE（NETWORK）
###     接入真实 Key + 网络后此处应返回 200 + translatedText
POST {{host}}/api/client/translate
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}
X-Device-Fingerprint: {{fingerprint}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Good morning",
  "sourceLang": "en",
  "targetLang": "zh",
  "direction": "IN"
}

### API Key 认证即可拿到当前计费周期的字符用量
### Free 版（api-free.deepl.com）
GET https://api-free.deepl.com/v2/usage
Authorization: DeepL-Auth-Key {{deepLKey1}}

### Pro 版（api.deepl.com）
GET https://api.deepl.com/v2/usage
Authorization: DeepL-Auth-Key {{deepLKey1}}